  "id": "methyldopa",
  "term": "methyldopa",
  "definition": "Methyldopa is a drug with blood-pressure-lowering effects. It is converted in the central nervous system into a substance that stimulates central alpha-2 receptors, which reduces sympathetic nerve activity and lowers blood pressure.",
